  "description": "Use when writing, improving, or debugging end-to-end tests that verify full user flows through the real system. Covers Playwright, Cypress, Selenium, Appium, and Maestro with Page Object Model pattern, critical path testing, codegen, and cross-browser/mobile strategies. USE FOR: Playwright, Cypress, Selenium, Appium, Maestro, browser testing, mobile testing, critical path tests, page object pattern, codegen DO NOT USE FOR: API-only testing (use api-testing or integration-testing), isolated function tests (use unit-testing), service contract verification (use contract-testing)",
